# Agent knowledge (read before implementing)

## Read order

1. **Session files** — `agent-workflow.mdc` §1 (Vault START_HERE → decisions-log → BUGS → TASKS → GOALS)
2. **Stress-test** — `.cursor/rules/stress-test.mdc` + `docs/cursor-agents/skills/stress-test.md` (challenge ideas before affirming; no glazing)
3. **Bug reports** — `.cursor/rules/bugs.mdc` when user reports a bug
4. **00 Read first** — vault: `Vault/3-Resources/Cursor agents/skills/00 Read first.md` · repo: `docs/cursor-agents/skills/00 Read first.md`
5. **Karpathy** — `skills/karpathy.md` (surgical, minimal-first — all code)
6. **UI / forms / modals** — `docs/SMITE2_DESIGN.md` → `GOALS.md` UI section → **`reuse-ui-patterns.md`** (grep repo before new dropdown/modal/tooltip) → `app/data.jsx` (`kitAbilityTooltipCard`) → skills `open-design.md` · optional exploration: `uiux-pro-max.md`
7. **Prose / marketing** — `stop-slop/` (full mirror) · `marketing/` (44 skills, local) · `product-marketing.md` · refresh: `npm run skills:import`
8. **Plan mode / multi-step** — `.cursor/rules/plan.mdc`

If `Vault/` is missing, use `docs/cursor-agents/` and `docs/SMITE2_DESIGN.md` as fallback.

