## UI rules (short)

- Cyan dark shell — match `kitAbilityTooltipCard` in `app/data.jsx`; see `docs/SMITE2_DESIGN.md`
- **Reuse before inventing** — grep whole project for existing dropdown/modal/tooltip; follow `docs/cursor-agents/skills/reuse-ui-patterns.md`; prefer `lib/uiDropdownStyles.js`, `lib/KitAbilityTooltipModal.jsx`, `getGodPantheon`
- Grep existing modal/tooltip patterns before new floating chrome
- One solid primary CTA per screen; propagate nav/sub-nav changes in `app/index.jsx`
- No unrelated palettes unless the user requests them

