- Optional session note: `Vault/3-Resources/Cursor agents/sessions/[date]-[task].md`
- Update `context-snapshot.md` when decisions affect future work
- Run `npm run vault:sync` after editing `docs/cursor-agents/` or `SMITE2_DESIGN.md`
